# The repository is edited on Windows and deployed to Linux (Vercel, Docker, GitHub
# Actions). Pinning LF everywhere keeps the two identical, silences the "LF will be
# replaced by CRLF" warnings on every git command, and stops line-ending-only diffs.
# The index already stores LF, so this changes no committed content.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Served web assets must stay byte-identical across platforms.
*.html text eol=lf
*.css  text eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf

# Never touched by line-ending conversion.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.db  binary
*.sqlite binary
